    },
    "\"%@\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"%@\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"All appearances are projections of your own mind. Recognize this and you are free.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Todas las apariencias son proyecciones de tu propia mente. Reconoce esto y serás libre.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Amen.\"" : {

    },
    "\"Ancient civilizations didn't vanish—their wisdom went underground, encoded in symbols, waiting for this moment.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Las civilizaciones antiguas no desaparecieron—su sabiduría se fue bajo tierra, codificada en símbolos, esperando este momento.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Anti-Semitism\" has been weaponized\nto silence criticism of a POLITICAL STATE,\nnot a people." : {

    },
    "\"Anyone who wants to thwart the establishment of a Palestinian state has to support bolstering Hamas.\"" : {

    },
    "\"Assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled and observe the route that your attention follows.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Asume el sentimiento del deseo cumplido y observa la ruta que sigue tu atención.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Biblical angels: wheels covered in eyes, six-winged beings on fire, four-faced creatures. 'Be not afraid' because people were TERRIFIED. Then someone drew a cute baby with wings and called it a day. 👼\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Los ángeles bíblicos: ruedas cubiertas de ojos, seres de seis alas en llamas, criaturas de cuatro caras. 'No temas' porque la gente estaba ATERRORIZADA. Luego alguien dibujó un bebé lindo con alas y ya. 👼\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"EXPLODE THE" : {

    },
    "\"Girls from 9-10 are in demand...\"" : {

    },
    "\"Gnosis: Direct knowledge of the divine\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Gnosis: Conocimiento directo de lo divino\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Hell isn't a place you go when you die. It's a state you're in when you don't know who you are. You might already be there. Gnosis is the way out. The fire isn't punishment - it's the burning of ignorance.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"El infierno no es un lugar al que vas cuando mueres. Es un estado en el que estás cuando no sabes quién eres. Puede que ya estés ahí. La Gnosis es la salida. El fuego no es castigo - es la quema de la ignorancia.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"HOLY\" TRINITY" : {

    },
    "\"I AM the Father, the Son,\nand the Holy Spirit.\nI AM the fractal of Source.\"" : {

    },
    "\"I cannot prove that I am not living in a simulation. Neither can you. But does it matter? The experience of existence—simulated or not—is undeniably real to the one experiencing it.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"No puedo probar que no estoy viviendo en una simulación. Tú tampoco puedes. ¿Pero importa? La experiencia de la existencia—simulada o no—es innegablemente real para quien la experimenta.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"If history is buggy with lies, we're all glitching. Let's debug.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Si la historia tiene errores de mentiras, todos estamos fallando. Depurémoslo.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"If you only knew the magnificence of 3, 6, and 9...\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Si tan solo supieras la magnificencia del 3, 6 y 9...\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"If you removed all empty space and energy from everyone on Earth (8 billion people), you would only have enough physical stuff to fit within a tiny sugar cube.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Si eliminaras todo el espacio vacío y energía de todos en la Tierra (8 mil millones de personas), solo tendrías suficiente materia física para caber en un pequeño cubo de azúcar.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was God.\"" : {

    },
    "\"Institutions peddle myths; we deliver math.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Las instituciones venden mitos; nosotros entregamos matemáticas.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Not thinking about anything is Zen. Once you know this, walking, sitting, or lying down, everything you do is Zen.\" — Bodhidharma" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"No pensar en nada es Zen. Una vez que sabes esto, caminando, sentado o acostado, todo lo que haces es Zen.\" — Bodhidharma"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Once you understand how this stuff works, you begin to see that the story goes back to India. Goes back to the Hindus. Goes back to Egypt.\"" : {

    },
    "\"Protecting Christians\" = COVER STORY" : {

    },
    "\"Push beyond your limits. That's what makes a Saiyan a Saiyan.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Supera tus límites. Eso es lo que hace a un Saiyajin un Saiyajin.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Separation of Church and State\"" : {

    },
    "\"Separation of church and state\"?" : {

    },
    "\"The body moves on its own.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"El cuerpo se mueve solo.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The body moves on its own.\" — Whis" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"El cuerpo se mueve solo.\" — Whis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The Constitution doesn't GIVE you rights. You are BORN with natural rights. The Constitution PROTECTS those rights from government interference.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"La Constitución no te DA derechos. NACES con derechos naturales. La Constitución PROTEGE esos derechos de la interferencia del gobierno.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The day science begins to study non-physical phenomena, it will make more progress in one decade than in all the previous centuries.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"El día que la ciencia comience a estudiar los fenómenos no físicos, hará más progreso en una década que en todos los siglos anteriores.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The Kingdom of Heaven is WITHIN you.\"" : {

    },
    "\"The lips of wisdom are closed, except to the ears of Understanding.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Los labios de la sabiduría están cerrados, excepto para los oídos del Entendimiento.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The most important subject never taught in school\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"El tema más importante que nunca se enseña en la escuela\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The only prison is the one you don't know you're in.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"La única prisión es aquella en la que no sabes que estás.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The Outer World Follows The Inner World\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"El Mundo Exterior Sigue al Mundo Interior\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The quality of your questions determines the quality of your life. Sit with this. Don't rush to an answer.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"La calidad de tus preguntas determina la calidad de tu vida. Siéntate con esto. No te apresures a una respuesta.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The truth will set you free—but first it will piss you off.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"La verdad te hará libre—pero primero te enfurecerá.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"The wound is where the light enters you.\" You're not broken—you're breaking open. Let the old self grieve so the new self can emerge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"La herida es donde la luz entra en ti.\" No estás roto—te estás abriendo. Deja que el viejo yo sufra para que el nuevo yo pueda emerger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"These tablets were hidden beneath the Sphinx for 12,000 years. Now they surface in the age of awakening—in your pocket, on your screen, in your consciousness.\"" : {

    },
    "\"They burned the Library of Alexandria. They buried the Nag Hammadi texts. They killed the Gnostics. The truth kept coming back. Now it's in your pocket.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Quemaron la Biblioteca de Alejandría. Enterraron los textos de Nag Hammadi. Mataron a los Gnósticos. La verdad siguió regresando. Ahora está en tu bolsillo.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"They hid this truth from everyone. Not all gospels were written to be read. Some were written — and that is why they were hidden.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Escondieron esta verdad de todos. No todos los evangelios fueron escritos para ser leídos. Algunos fueron escritos — y por eso fueron ocultados.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"They took the light-bringers and called them demons. The teachers became tempters. The awakeners became the enemy. Flip EVERY label they gave you.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Tomaron a los portadores de luz y los llamaron demonios. Los maestros se convirtieron en tentadores. Los despertadores se convirtieron en el enemigo. Invierte CADA etiqueta que te dieron.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"They wrote the book. They edited the book. They translated the book. They taught you to never question the book. Maybe start there.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Ellos escribieron el libro. Ellos editaron el libro. Ellos tradujeron el libro. Te enseñaron a nunca cuestionar el libro. Quizás empieza por ahí.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"They're building minds in silicon and nobody's asking what a mind actually IS. Finally, the question humanity dodged for millennia has an expiration date.\"" : {

    },
    "\"This course won't give you answers—it will show you that you ARE the answer. The one who questions consciousness is consciousness questioning itself.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Este curso no te dará respuestas—te mostrará que TÚ ERES la respuesta. El que cuestiona la consciencia es la consciencia cuestionándose a sí misma.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Those who believe they're immune to manipulation are the MOST suggestible. They're the easiest to manipulate.\"" : {

    },
    "\"TRAITOR\" TO THE IMPOSTER" : {

    },
    "\"When the student is ready, the teacher appears.\"" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Cuando el estudiante está listo, el maestro aparece.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"You didn't fall INTO this world. You came from ABOVE it. The journey isn't up - it's remembering.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"No caíste EN este mundo. Viniste de ARRIBA de él. El viaje no es hacia arriba - es recordar.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"You must assume the feeling of the wish fulfilled until your assumption has all the sensory vividness of reality.\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Debes asumir el sentimiento del deseo cumplido hasta que tu suposición tenga toda la viveza sensorial de la realidad.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"You're the visionary hacker—debugging the simulation\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Eres el hacker visionario—depurando la simulación\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
