    "Many Colors" : {

    },
    "Many European Zionists are Ashkenazi —\ndescended from Khazar converts, from Eastern Europe.\nNot originally from the Levant." : {

    },
    "Many more existed — and were banned. Gospels that did not speak of obedience, but of knowledge. That preached not guilt, but awakening. That did not show a divinized, untouchable, distant Jesus — but a teacher who reminded human beings who they really were." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muchos más existieron — y fueron prohibidos. Evangelios que no hablaban de obediencia, sino de conocimiento. Que no predicaban culpa, sino despertar. Que no mostraban un Jesús divinizado, intocable, distante — sino un maestro que recordaba a los seres humanos quiénes realmente eran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MAP" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MAPA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mario in the game has no idea what to do. He doesn't know why turtles are coming at him. He doesn't know he can jump on blocks for coins and power-ups." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mario en el juego no tiene idea de qué hacer. No sabe por qué las tortugas vienen hacia él. No sabe que puede saltar sobre bloques para obtener monedas y mejoras."
