    },
    "The man you know as Jesus was never called that. Not by his mother. Not by his followers. His name was Yeshua—and it wasn't just a name." : {

    },
    "The Mandela Effect is likely explained by the fallibility of human memory, confabulation, and social influence—not alternate timelines. However, exploring these phenomena helps us understand how memory works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El Efecto Mandela probablemente se explica por la falibilidad de la memoria humana, la confabulación y la influencia social—no líneas de tiempo alternativas. Sin embargo, explorar estos fenómenos nos ayuda a entender cómo funciona la memoria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The map is not the territory. The name is not the thing. But all maps point to the same mountain." : {
