        }
      }
    },
    "What's on your mind?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Qué tienes en mente?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's the empowered version?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Cuál es la versión empoderada?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Christianity became the official religion of the Empire, spirituality was no longer an experience — it became a doctrine. The gospels that did not uphold guilt, eternal sacrifice, and the authority of the Church were branded as heresy.\n\nNot because they were fake.\nBut because they were too free." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando el Cristianismo se convirtió en la religión oficial del Imperio, la espiritualidad ya no era una experiencia — se convirtió en una doctrina. Los evangelios que no sostenían la culpa, el sacrificio eterno y la autoridad de la Iglesia fueron tildados de herejía.\n\nNo porque fueran falsos.\nSino porque eran demasiado libres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When corporations cause problems, they blame others:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando las corporaciones causan problemas, culpan a otros:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When large groups of people remember events differently than they occurred. Named after many remembering Nelson Mandela dying in prison in the 1980s—he actually died in 2013." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando grandes grupos de personas recuerdan eventos de manera diferente a como ocurrieron. Nombrado por muchos que recuerdan a Nelson Mandela muriendo en prisión en los años 1980—en realidad murió en 2013."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When one mind climbs, it changes more than just that mind. It changes everyone connected to it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando una mente asciende, cambia más que solo esa mente. Cambia a todos los conectados a ella."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When reality ≠ what you were taught" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando la realidad ≠ lo que te enseñaron"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When scripture speaks of 'Russia (Rosh) coming down to attack Israel,' it's not about geopolitics. It's about YOUR inner battle:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando la escritura habla de 'Rusia (Rosh) descendiendo para atacar a Israel,' no se trata de geopolítica. Se trata de TU batalla interior:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the Epstein files dropped, the Vatican went SILENT. Then suddenly... they had something to say." : {

    },
    "When there is HARMONY between your Spirit (Isis) and your Mind (Ra), then there is GOD (El) in you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando hay ARMONÍA entre tu Espíritu (Isis) y tu Mente (Ra), entonces hay DIOS (El) en ti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When They Changed His Name" : {

    },
    "When we think of the Gospels, we believe there are only four. Matthew. Mark. Luke. John. This is what every church, every school, every institution tells you.\n\nThis is not true." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando pensamos en los Evangelios, creemos que solo hay cuatro. Mateo. Marcos. Lucas. Juan. Esto es lo que cada iglesia, cada escuela, cada institución te dice.\n\nEsto no es verdad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you feel reactive, pause and ask:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando te sientas reactivo, pausa y pregunta:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you notice scarcity thinking:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando notes pensamiento de escasez:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you see people driving nice cars, living in beautiful homes, flying first class—most people ask about their JOB. This is scarcity thinking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando ves personas conduciendo autos bonitos, viviendo en casas hermosas, volando en primera clase—la mayoría pregunta sobre su TRABAJO. Esto es pensamiento de escasez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you start seeing through the illusions, emotions arise. Grief for the life you thought was real. Anger at those who lied. Betrayal from systems you trusted.\n\nThese feelings are not obstacles to awakening—they ARE the awakening. You cannot skip this part." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando empiezas a ver a través de las ilusiones, surgen emociones. Duelo por la vida que creías real. Ira hacia quienes mintieron. Traición de sistemas en los que confiabas.\n\nEstos sentimientos no son obstáculos para el despertar—SON el despertar. No puedes saltarte esta parte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you think differently about money:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando piensas diferente sobre el dinero:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where Are You in Your Journey?" : {

    },
    "Where did I go unconscious today?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Dónde perdí la consciencia hoy?"
          }
        }
